  "answer": {
    "summary": "Tesla's revenue data in the table begins in FY2011 because no XBRL facts—revenue or otherwise—exist for Tesla before that year. This aligns with Tesla's IPO and subsequent shift to accelerated filer status, which required standard US‑GAAP revenue tagging. Prior to FY2011 Tesla either used custom tags or omitted the standard revenue elements, so the revenue_facts table shows no entries.",
